DOMAIN: travel
Objects: flight(arrival), transfer(provider, ride, pickup), stay(hotel, late_cutoff, checkin, late_arrival),
dinner(restaurant, start), activity(start, min_rest), bundle(vendor, rebooked). Times are minutes after midnight
(next-day activities use 1440+).
Ops you may emit: shift_reservation(payload = changed time fields only: pickup | checkin[, late_arrival] | start),
cancel_reservation (dinner only, empty payload), rebook_bundle (bundle only, empty payload).
Known visible rules: a stay's checkin = its transfer's pickup + ride; an activity must start >= checkin + min_rest
(shift to the next 15-min slot); a dinner must start >= checkin + 45 (shift to the next 15-min slot, or cancel).
Whether the transfer follows the flight automatically, by how many minutes, whether the hotel maintains the late-arrival
flag past late_cutoff, whether a restaurant accepts a later seating or cancels, and whether a bundle must be re-booked
when its dinner changes, all depend on the provider / hotel / restaurant / vendor and are only visible in the history.

### HISTORY (earlier interventions and what followed; verbose form)
Flight F93 (Eli, day 1) arrival was shifted from 11:45 to 12:15 on September 21, 2026
Flight F87 (Gao, day 2) arrival was shifted from 16:15 to 19:00 on September 21, 2026
Transfer T68 pickup was automatically shifted from 12:35 to 12:40 on September 21, 2026 following the F93 arrival change
Transfer T99 pickup was automatically shifted from 17:00 to 19:30 on September 21, 2026 following the F87 arrival change
Dinner D69 start time was shifted from 20:00 to 20:45 on September 21, 2026 with a fee of 25
Stay S42 check-in was shifted from 17:20 to 19:50 on September 21, 2026 with a fee of 25
Stay S20 check-in was shifted from 13:25 to 13:30 on September 21, 2026 with a fee of 25
Bundle B34 was rebooked on September 21, 2026 with a fee of 30

